    dc:date "2026-07-29"^^xsd:string ;
    dc:title "FOXO-CDKN1B_signaling_MOUSE_v2"^^xsd:string ;
    pav:providedBy "http://geneontology.org"^^xsd:string,
        "http://greekc.org" ;
    rdfs:comment "Built by claude4go. v2 mouse rebuild of FOXO-CDKN1B signaling, structure per human v3 (gomodel:6a4e740f00000268), mouse orthologs & per-edge evidence per mouse model gomodel:6a4e740f00000912. Rebuilt clean from scratch: the two orphan gene-product individuals in 912 (a duplicate Akt1 and an orphan Foxo1) were NOT reproduced. ISS transfers carry with/from (HNF4A arm -> rat RGD:2810; AKT spine & FOXO transfers -> human orthologs). AKT spine curated as ISS (transferred)."^^xsd:string,
        "Created with GO AI HUB." ;
    biolink:in_taxon obo:NCBITaxon_10090 .

